    "native": "Fresh native engines, Auditorium, Spruce and Mahogany, Finger/Pick/Thumb, MIDI100/127, G4/A4/B4/E5 highE channel6, room0,48kHz,2s held notes.17float32 columns. Separate copies of the actual deployed BodyBank recurrence and capture filter are fed exact F/T arguments delivered to renderBody; no production DSP edits.",
