    "decay": "0.2s Hann FFT windows starting0.2..1.6s,0.1s hop; power in +/-max(10Hz,1% harmonicHz) around nominal equal-tempered H10; ordinary least-squares10log10(power) versus window center. These are driven held-string partial decays, not free radiator T60s.",
    "raw_pressure": "Verified Mores archive, authorsSI calibration and H1 extraction in AuditBridgeSpatialMap; g35 causal24000sample taper and g2112000. Heave=(treble+bass)/2,moment=(treble-bass)/2. Band values are10log10(mean moment |H|2 /mean heave |H|2). Fitted comparison decodes134g35 source modes before authored runtime transformations.",
    "raw_admittance": "Normalized two-point heave=(tt+bb+2cross)/4,rock=(tt+bb-2cross)/4,cross average of two opposite measurements. Sensors are offset from hammer impacts, so this is an approximation, not verified collocated reciprocal mobility. Negative-real summaries include both the raw response and the documented2sample instrumentation phase advance used by the bridge generator; after that advance the sampled g35 rocking bands are positive-real.",
    "scope": "Original auxiliary measured/continuation split is excluded because its extra joint-pole body also occupies slots beyond ordered. The force/moment pressure split is valid for both models."
  },
